<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa says speaking to Asian airlines.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa says speaking to Asian airlines.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG is speaking to a number of airlines with a view to securing a large partner in Asia but had not yet made a decision, a Lufthansa spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>She would not comment on a report in the magazine Der Spiegel that said it was discussing an alliance with All Nippon Airways (ANA), Japan's largest domestic carrier.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
